 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "segment trie whose children are literal segments plus one \"*\" child; a query walks the trie depth first, literal child before \"*\", carrying the wildcard count, pruning branches whose count already exceeds the best complete match, and keeps the first best match found in that order. Complexity target: O(min(T, 2^L)) per call worst case, T = trie nodes, L = path segments; O(L) per addRoute/O(total pattern segments) space.",
